Upstream parts and their terms:

1. Audio encoder: google/embeddinggemma-2 (audio tower), Apache License 2.0. The top 2 of its 12 conformer layers
   were changed by further training; the other weights are unchanged.

2. Training labels, part 1 (~970 h): transcripts produced by bodhan-ai/indic-transcribe-core
   (Indic Open Model License v1.0; its base model nvidia/canary-1b-v2 carries its own terms).

3. Training labels, part 2 (~780 h): transcripts produced by Prahaladha/hima-asr (Apache 2.0 for its own parts).
