4. Training audio: YODAS v3 (espnet/yodas3), CC-BY-3.0, Hindi YouTube audio from Creative-Commons-licensed videos.
   Fine-tuning/eval audio: Kathbath (ai4bharat/Kathbath), CC-BY-4.0. Evaluation only: Lahaja (ai4bharat/Lahaja), CC-BY-4.0.

5. Design: inspired by QUAN-Transcribe (github.com/qnguyen3/QUAN-Transcribe); the code here is an independent
   implementation.

6. kenlm/hi3.arpa: a word 3-gram language model built from the teacher transcripts in 2. and 3. It is covered by the
